I have a bicycle.
I sometimes ride the bicycle.
But today my bicycle is not fine.
I take my bicycle to a mechanic.
This shop is near my house.
I say, "Hello bhaiya."
The mechanic says, "Hello madam, what happened?"
I say, "I need a service for my bicycle."
The bhaiya says, "Okay madam, I fix bicycles every day."
I ask, "How much time does the service take?"
He says, "It takes two days."
I say, "Today is Tuesday."
"I will come back on Thursday."
I ask, "At what time on Thursday?"
He says, "At six o'clock in the evening."
I think.
I always go to the gym on Thursday at half past five.
I say, "Is seven o'clock in the evening fine?"
The bhaiya says, "Yes madam, seven o'clock is perfectly fine."
I leave my bicycle there.
I walk back home.
